o.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V7qz1_zsGywQ7kNvwE0mjiC&_nc_oc=AdrtK_GEShvCt-9Dfm8lBR4X1HX1A722fym9-F8mv85pjnATXEV9RK9dTRNpU8-zpKI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKQcGzyVszHCZ3qfsaRB-Zqk-1SCtlakTEA8M82CFO9oQ&oe=6AAE89A3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C0YjB62nDKIQ7kNvwHl_Wg7&_nc_oc=AdoO3c3cveU9q3GHRIfomNfSRvkknKnJ-IWkfLHwpQXp2EhWDT1nwK-gVlmBNjjGRU0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKNDXmPTiqzQnKHBloO8hijUdTzPYPRkJlAMZYQvajmtQ&oe=6AAEADDD"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hB5OcWXXfQMQ7kNvwFxFCfO&_nc_oc=Ado4sIaC3sVJtngm2BSdnA24g1377u_jF8xHuu_tS1BWevNVgzRCENDkj-RZHNxYays&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKU8-tJYttBq2wstEBXDimEjh-q7es1tT-giE7Rg1pgsA&oe=6AAE9C4A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818874_1061729115797769_7442033601794403369_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1